[
  {
    "index": 1,
    "sceneId": "seg-001",
    "startSeconds": 0,
    "endSeconds": 3.072,
    "startFrame": 0,
    "endFrame": 92,
    "text": "这条消息已经出发\n要三天后才到"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "sceneId": "seg-002",
    "startSeconds": 3.2520000000000002,
    "endSeconds": 3.935636363636364,
    "startFrame": 98,
    "endFrame": 118,
    "text": "没有卡住"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "sceneId": "seg-002",
    "startSeconds": 3.935636363636364,
    "endSeconds": 6.841090909090909,
    "startFrame": 118,
    "endFrame": 205,
    "text": "Roost 会按距离\n和鸟的速度来送信"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "sceneId": "seg-002",
    "startSeconds": 6.841090909090909,
    "endSeconds": 8.892,
    "startFrame": 205,
    "endFrame": 267,
    "text": "地图上还能看到它飞到哪儿"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "sceneId": "seg-003",
    "startSeconds": 9.072,
    "endSeconds": 12.989877551020408,
    "startFrame": 272,
    "endFrame": 390,
    "text": "有人等鸟送信时\n用上了伊丽莎白时代的英语"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "sceneId": "seg-003",
    "startSeconds": 12.989877551020408,
    "endSeconds": 16.289142857142856,
    "startFrame": 390,
    "endFrame": 489,
    "text": "帖子出现后三天\n用户从一万涨到十万"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "sceneId": "seg-003",
    "startSeconds": 16.289142857142856,
    "endSeconds": 19.176,
    "startFrame": 489,
    "endFrame": 575,
    "text": "这样的等待\n为什么值得讲给别人"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "sceneId": "seg-004",
    "startSeconds": 19.355999999999998,
    "endSeconds": 23.579684210526313,
    "startFrame": 581,
    "endFrame": 707,
    "text": "Mendelsohn 想让\n不停跳出的通知先安静一会儿"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "sceneId": "seg-004",
    "startSeconds": 23.579684210526313,
    "endSeconds": 25.775999999999996,
    "startFrame": 707,
    "endFrame": 773,
    "text": "消息一飞走\n你就不用守着手机"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "sceneId": "seg-004",
    "startSeconds": 25.775999999999996,
    "endSeconds": 30.506526315789472,
    "startFrame": 773,
    "endFrame": 915,
    "text": "有位作者试用 Roost 后说\n等待让他更认真地想自己要说什么"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "sceneId": "seg-004",
    "startSeconds": 30.506526315789472,
    "endSeconds": 32.196,
    "startFrame": 915,
    "endFrame": 966,
    "text": "他也开始盼着消息送到"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 33.096,
    "endSeconds": 35.305565217391305,
    "startFrame": 993,
    "endFrame": 1059,
    "text": "Roost 最早只是个业余项目"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 35.305565217391305,
    "endSeconds": 38.146434782608694,
    "startFrame": 1059,
    "endFrame": 1144,
    "text": "是 Mendelsohn 和朋友\n一起做的"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 38.146434782608694,
    "endSeconds": 40.67165217391304,
    "startFrame": 1144,
    "endFrame": 1220,
    "text": "概念视频火了以后\n他把应用做了出来"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 40.67165217391304,
    "endSeconds": 41.934260869565215,
    "startFrame": 1220,
    "endFrame": 1258,
    "text": "他本来没打算公开"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 41.934260869565215,
    "endSeconds": 43.67034782608695,
    "startFrame": 1258,
    "endFrame": 1310,
    "text": "朋友们很喜欢\n还催他上架"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "sceneId": "seg-005",
    "startSeconds": 43.67034782608695,
    "endSeconds": 47.616,
    "startFrame": 1310,
    "endFrame": 1428,
    "text": "2026 年 4 月 28 日\nRoost 进了 App Store"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "sceneId": "seg-006",
    "startSeconds": 48.516,
    "endSeconds": 50.3946976744186,
    "startFrame": 1455,
    "endFrame": 1512,
    "text": "每只鸟的速度不一样"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "sceneId": "seg-006",
    "startSeconds": 50.3946976744186,
    "endSeconds": 53.108372093023256,
    "startFrame": 1512,
    "endFrame": 1593,
    "text": "两个人离得越远\n消息到得越慢"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "sceneId": "seg-006",
    "startSeconds": 53.108372093023256,
    "endSeconds": 55.19581395348837,
    "startFrame": 1593,
    "endFrame": 1656,
    "text": "整段路线都画在地图上"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "sceneId": "seg-006",
    "startSeconds": 55.19581395348837,
    "endSeconds": 57.492,
    "startFrame": 1656,
    "endFrame": 1725,
    "text": "鸟飞到哪儿\n一眼就能看见"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "sceneId": "seg-007",
    "startSeconds": 58.391999999999996,
    "endSeconds": 61.67542857142857,
    "startFrame": 1752,
    "endFrame": 1850,
    "text": "等鸟的时候\n你可以收集、训练不同的鸟"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "sceneId": "seg-007",
    "startSeconds": 61.67542857142857,
    "endSeconds": 63.60685714285714,
    "startFrame": 1850,
    "endFrame": 1908,
    "text": "你也可以玩一局小游戏"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "sceneId": "seg-007",
    "startSeconds": 63.60685714285714,
    "endSeconds": 66.89028571428571,
    "startFrame": 1908,
    "endFrame": 2007,
    "text": "朋友的鸟还在路上\n你可以先去做别的事"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "sceneId": "seg-007",
    "startSeconds": 66.89028571428571,
    "endSeconds": 70.56,
    "startFrame": 2007,
    "endFrame": 2117,
    "text": "那位作者等着等着\n反而开始盼那只鸟落地了"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 71.46000000000001,
    "endSeconds": 74.10857142857144,
    "startFrame": 2144,
    "endFrame": 2223,
    "text": "用户后来还玩出了\n自己的说话方式"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 74.10857142857144,
    "endSeconds": 77.11028571428572,
    "startFrame": 2223,
    "endFrame": 2313,
    "text": "TechCrunch 记录了\n这篇帖子"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 77.11028571428572,
    "endSeconds": 79.75885714285715,
    "startFrame": 2313,
    "endFrame": 2393,
    "text": "一位母亲在帖子里\n说起女儿和朋友"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 79.75885714285715,
    "endSeconds": 82.23085714285715,
    "startFrame": 2393,
    "endFrame": 2467,
    "text": "他们用伊丽莎白时代的英语\n聊天"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 82.23085714285715,
    "endSeconds": 85.58571428571429,
    "startFrame": 2467,
    "endFrame": 2568,
    "text": "每句话都要等鸟送到\n聊天也有了自己的仪式"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "sceneId": "seg-008",
    "startSeconds": 85.58571428571429,
    "endSeconds": 88.76400000000001,
    "startFrame": 2568,
    "endFrame": 2663,
    "text": "帖子出现后的三天里\n用户从一万涨到十万"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "sceneId": "seg-009",
    "startSeconds": 89.66400000000002,
    "endSeconds": 93.79680000000002,
    "startFrame": 2690,
    "endFrame": 2814,
    "text": "到 7 月 7 日\nRoost 已经有二十五万多名用户"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "sceneId": "seg-009",
    "startSeconds": 93.79680000000002,
    "endSeconds": 95.96160000000002,
    "startFrame": 2814,
    "endFrame": 2879,
    "text": "每天有十万多个活跃对话"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "sceneId": "seg-009",
    "startSeconds": 95.96160000000002,
    "endSeconds": 98.52000000000001,
    "startFrame": 2879,
    "endFrame": 2956,
    "text": "广告和付费获客\n一分钱都没花"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "sceneId": "seg-010",
    "startSeconds": 99.42000000000002,
    "endSeconds": 101.82355555555557,
    "startFrame": 2983,
    "endFrame": 3055,
    "text": "想换一只信使\n可以收集和训练"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "sceneId": "seg-010",
    "startSeconds": 101.82355555555557,
    "endSeconds": 104.5968888888889,
    "startFrame": 3055,
    "endFrame": 3138,
    "text": "你也可以去轮换商店\n买一只喜欢的"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "sceneId": "seg-010",
    "startSeconds": 104.5968888888889,
    "endSeconds": 109.40400000000001,
    "startFrame": 3138,
    "endFrame": 3282,
    "text": "Roost 还提供支持者订阅\n用户也能用这种方式支持项目"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "sceneId": "seg-011",
    "startSeconds": 110.60400000000001,
    "endSeconds": 113.15078260869566,
    "startFrame": 3318,
    "endFrame": 3395,
    "text": "Roost 要用位置来计算距离"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "sceneId": "seg-011",
    "startSeconds": 113.15078260869566,
    "endSeconds": 114.06034782608697,
    "startFrame": 3395,
    "endFrame": 3422,
    "text": "默认情况下"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "sceneId": "seg-011",
    "startSeconds": 114.06034782608697,
    "endSeconds": 116.2433043478261,
    "startFrame": 3422,
    "endFrame": 3487,
    "text": "朋友只能看到你所在的城市"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "sceneId": "seg-011",
    "startSeconds": 116.2433043478261,
    "endSeconds": 119.51773913043479,
    "startFrame": 3487,
    "endFrame": 3586,
    "text": "只有你选中的亲密好友\n才能看到精确位置"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "sceneId": "seg-011",
    "startSeconds": 119.51773913043479,
    "endSeconds": 123.156,
    "startFrame": 3586,
    "endFrame": 3695,
    "text": "Pen Pals 也得两边都同意\n对话才会打开"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "sceneId": "seg-012",
    "startSeconds": 124.656,
    "endSeconds": 126.43954285714287,
    "startFrame": 3740,
    "endFrame": 3793,
    "text": "再回到开头那条消息"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "sceneId": "seg-012",
    "startSeconds": 126.43954285714287,
    "endSeconds": 129.01577142857144,
    "startFrame": 3793,
    "endFrame": 3870,
    "text": "Roost 把路程画在地图上"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "sceneId": "seg-012",
    "startSeconds": 129.01577142857144,
    "endSeconds": 132.78102857142858,
    "startFrame": 3870,
    "endFrame": 3983,
    "text": "不同的鸟加上等待\n改变了消息送达时的感觉"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "sceneId": "seg-012",
    "startSeconds": 132.78102857142858,
    "endSeconds": 135.7536,
    "startFrame": 3983,
    "endFrame": 4073,
    "text": "到 7 月 10 日\n注册用户到了三十万"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "sceneId": "seg-012",
    "startSeconds": 135.7536,
    "endSeconds": 138.52800000000002,
    "startFrame": 4073,
    "endFrame": 4156,
    "text": "开头那只鸟\n还在地图上朝朋友飞"
  }
]
